# System Operational Rules

## 1) Default Testing Account

- If testing login is needed, use this account first:
  - Username: `tito@noohtify.com`
  - Password: `abcd1234`
- If login fails, report clearly and ask before creating/replacing users.

## 2) Rule for Adding New Menu

- Every time a new menu is proposed/implemented, ask first:
  - Should it go into an existing category, or
  - Should we create a new category?
- Existing menu categories in current system:
  - `Main` (Dashboard only, top of sidebar)
  - `Bisnis` (Sales, List Company, Category Company)
  - `Operation` (New Project, List Project, Project Board)
  - `Report` (Reports, Generate Report, Finance Report, Realization Report)
  - `Finance` (Monitoring, Categories)
  - `User Management` (My Profile, Teams & Users, Access Control)
  - `System Settings` (Settings, Project Roles, System Log)
- Do not add a new menu item before category decision is confirmed.

## 3) Monitoring and Dashboard Synchronization

- Data shown in monitoring pages and dashboard must stay synchronized.
- For any feature affecting dashboard/monitoring data:
  - Update API/query logic and related frontend consumers together.
  - Verify both views show consistent totals/metrics after changes.
  - If mismatch risk exists, call it out and propose a fix before finalizing.
